exports[`витрины: openapi-output-file и markdown-output-file > example-amqp: Markdown-витрина (snapshot), asyncapi.yaml не меняется 1`] = `
"# Example AMQP Service 1.0.0

End-to-end test fixture covering AMQP publish/consume features.

**Витрина AsyncAPI-документа.** Этот файл построен из AsyncAPI-описания сервиса
только для просмотра; кодогенерация и проверки идут от AsyncAPI.
Транспорт: **AMQP**.

| Сервер | Protocol | Host | Pathname | Описание |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| \`rabbit\` | \`amqp\` | \`rabbit.example.com:5672\` | \`/example\` | Example RabbitMQ broker |

Операции — в разделах «Принимает» и «Публикует»: «принимает» — сервис получает сообщение,
«публикует» — сервис отправляет.

## Содержание

- [Принимает](#принимает)
  - [consumeAck](#consumeack) — \`v1-events-ack\` — consume acknowledgement commands
- [Публикует](#публикует)
  - [publishEvent](#publishevent) — \`v1-events-created\` — publish a new event
  - [broadcastAnnouncement](#broadcastannouncement) — \`announcement-broadcast\` — broadcast an announcement to all subscribers
- [Модели](#модели) — 9

## Принимает

### consumeAck

**принимает** \`v1-events-ack\` — consume acknowledgement commands

Processes acknowledgement commands from downstream consumers.

| Поле | Значение |
|---|---|
| Направление | принимает — сервис получает сообщение |
| Routing key | \`v1-events-ack\` |
| Очередь | \`ack-requests-queue\` |
| Очередь durable | \`true\` |
| Очередь autoDelete | \`false\` |
| Сообщение | [AckCommand](#ackcommand) |
| Content type | \`application/json\` |

**Сообщение** [AckCommand](#ackcommand) · \`application/json\`

| Поле | Тип | Обязательное | Описание |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`uid\` | [Uuid](#uuid) | да | Identifier of the original message being acknowledged |
| \`success\` | \`boolean\` | да | Whether the consumer processed the message successfully |
| \`error\` | \`string\` |  | Optional error description |

## Публикует

### publishEvent

**публикует** \`v1-events-created\` — publish a new event

Publishes a domain event onto the events exchange.

Channel for individual domain events

| Поле | Значение |
|---|---|
| Направление | публикует — сервис отправляет сообщение |
| Routing key | \`v1-events-created\` |
| Exchange | \`events-exchange\` |
| Тип exchange | \`direct\` |
| Exchange durable | \`true\` |
| Сообщение | [EventMessage](#eventmessage) |
| Content type | \`application/json\` |

**Сообщение** [EventMessage](#eventmessage) · \`application/json\`

| Поле | Тип | Обязательное | Описание |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`uid\` | [Uuid](#uuid) | да | Unique message identifier |
| \`sentAt\` | [Microseconds](#microseconds) | да |  |
| \`payload\` | [EventPayload](#eventpayload) | да |  |

### broadcastAnnouncement

**публикует** \`announcement-broadcast\` — broadcast an announcement to all subscribers

Fanout exchange — every bound queue receives the message.

| Поле | Значение |
|---|---|
| Направление | публикует — сервис отправляет сообщение |
| Exchange | \`announcements-fanout\` |
| Тип exchange | \`fanout\` |
| Exchange durable | \`true\` |
| Сообщение | [AnnouncementMessage](#announcementmessage) |
| Content type | \`application/json\` |

**Сообщение** [AnnouncementMessage](#announcementmessage) · \`application/json\`

| Поле | Тип | Обязательное | Описание |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`uid\` | [Uuid](#uuid) | да | Announcement identifier |
| \`message\` | \`string\` | да | Announcement text |

## Модели

| Модель | Описание |
|---|---|
| [Tag](#tag) | Key-value tag attached to events |
| [EventPayload](#eventpayload) | Detailed event payload |
| [EventCategory](#eventcategory) | Category of an event |
| [Priority](#priority) | Priority of a notification |
| [EventMessage](#eventmessage) | Event message sent on the events exchange |
| [Uuid](#uuid) | UUID v7 identifier |
| [Microseconds](#microseconds) | Unix timestamp microseconds as string (to avoid 64-bit precision loss) |
| [AnnouncementMessage](#announcementmessage) | Broadcast announcement, sent via fanout |
| [AckCommand](#ackcommand) | Acknowledgement command from a consumer back to the producer |

### Tag

Key-value tag attached to events

| Поле | Тип | Обязательное | Описание |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`name\` | \`string\` | да | Tag name |
| \`value\` | \`string\` | да | Tag value |

### EventPayload

Detailed event payload

| Поле | Тип | Обязательное | Описание |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`text\` | \`string\` | да | Free-form text |
| \`category\` | [EventCategory](#eventcategory) | да |  |
| \`priority\` | [Priority](#priority) |  | Optional priority override |
| \`tags\` | [Tag](#tag)[] | да | Arbitrary tags |
| \`extra\` | \`map\` string → \`string\` | да | Arbitrary extension parameters |

### EventCategory

Category of an event

Тип: \`string\`; значения: \`Created\`, \`Updated\`, \`Deleted\`

### Priority

Priority of a notification

Тип: \`string\`; значения: \`Low\`, \`Normal\`, \`High\`

### EventMessage

Event message sent on the events exchange

Сообщение операций: [publishEvent](#publishevent)

| Поле | Тип | Обязательное | Описание |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`uid\` | [Uuid](#uuid) | да | Unique message identifier |
| \`sentAt\` | [Microseconds](#microseconds) | да |  |
| \`payload\` | [EventPayload](#eventpayload) | да |  |

### Uuid

UUID v7 identifier

Тип: \`string\`

### Microseconds

Unix timestamp microseconds as string (to avoid 64-bit precision loss)

Тип: \`string\`

### AnnouncementMessage

Broadcast announcement, sent via fanout

Сообщение операций: [broadcastAnnouncement](#broadcastannouncement)

| Поле | Тип | Обязательное | Описание |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`uid\` | [Uuid](#uuid) | да | Announcement identifier |
| \`message\` | \`string\` | да | Announcement text |

### AckCommand

Acknowledgement command from a consumer back to the producer

Сообщение операций: [consumeAck](#consumeack)

| Поле | Тип | Обязательное | Описание |
|---|---|---|---|
| \`uid\` | [Uuid](#uuid) | да | Identifier of the original message being acknowledged |
| \`success\` | \`boolean\` | да | Whether the consumer processed the message successfully |
| \`error\` | \`string\` |  | Optional error description |
"
`;

